# Run outputs -- regenerable, and the checkpoints are large. Never committed.
runs/
evaltrees/
# Analysis artifacts. NOTE: the repo-root .gitignore already excludes *.png and *.pdf
# globally (it is a code-only repository), so the figures analyze.py produces are not
# committed either way. The CSV/markdown are listed here for the same reason -- they are
# outputs of collect.py/analyze.py and are rebuilt from runs/ in seconds.
results/*.csv
results/*.png
results/*.md
results/eval/
